  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0017_52714a7f98f1.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.68681in;height:1.58681in\" /></p><p>Since the chord subtends a right angle at the origin,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Now, the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;lies on the parabola,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />i.e.&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>6</mn><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br />So,&nbsp;<math><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>48</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence, the length of the chord&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;units</p>"
  }
